# 项目统一 C++ 代码风格（clang-format-15）
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 100
PointerAlignment: Left
SortIncludes: true
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
BreakBeforeBraces: Custom
BraceWrapping:
  AfterFunction: false
  AfterControlStatement: Never
  AfterClass: true
  AfterStruct: true
